 r filosofi\, idehistorie og policy.\n \nArranged by Students for Liberty D
 enmark and Liberal Alliance Ungdom. The Danish Freedom summit\, gathers th
 e classical liberal Denmark and offers the oppertunity to attend internati
 onal speakers within philosophy\, ideology and policy\n \nProgram:\n10:00 
 - 10:15 Velkommen\n10:15 - 11:15 Eamonn Butler\n11:15 - 12:15 Panel : Otto
